    Fix aborted job status publication race (#4633)
    
    ## Summary
    
    Port #4613 from `2.8` to `main`.
    
    - Fix the aborted-job status publication race in server/job-runner
    handling.
    - Add focused coverage for the server and job-runner status behavior.
    
    ## Why
    
    This aligns `main` with the 2.8 fix so aborted job status publication is
    deterministic and does not race with job completion/status updates.
    
    ## Validation
    
    - `python3 -m py_compile nvflare/private/fed/server/fed_server.py
    nvflare/private/fed/server/job_runner.py
    tests/unit_test/private/fed/server/fed_server_test.py
    tests/unit_test/private/fed/server/job_runner_test.py`
    - `/Users/yuantingh/NVFlare/venv/bin/python -m pytest
    tests/unit_test/private/fed/server/fed_server_test.py
    tests/unit_test/private/fed/server/job_runner_test.py -q` (`46 passed`)
    - `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`
